## Cycle 6 Honest Synthesis

**The strategy is sharp. The execution plan is over-optimistic by a factor of 3–8x on key gates.**

| Gate | Plan stated | Industry-benchmark reality |
|---|---|---|
| Warm-intro-to-discovery-call conversion | 63% | 15–30% |
| Discovery-call-to-paid-sprint conversion | 60% | 8–20% |
| Big 4 LOI signature timeline | 90 days | 6–9 months |
| FedRAMP Moderate authorization | 9 months | 12–24 months |
| F50 procurement for >$50K vendor | "CIO discretionary" | Vendor risk review (60–90 days) |
| DPA negotiation with model providers | 5 working days | 4–12 weeks |

**Reset required**: Execution plan timeline should be re-baselined from 90 days to **18 months**. This converts the plan from a sprint to a stage-gated 6-quarter program.

