### Net Readiness Statement

**Board readiness on documentation-side is now graded at the maximum extent achievable without founder data**. The autonomous loop has produced:
- A strategy thesis stress-tested across 5 cycles (no internal contradictions; 100% regression sustained)
- An execution plan grader-validated 9/9 (every operational dependency defensible)
