**What the board literally says**: NOT "ready, write the check" — instead, "diligence extension, $1.5M conditional commit, named co-lead required, 30-day reference-call sprint." This IS the realistic seed-stage outcome for a pre-revenue founder team without prior exit history. It is **not failure**.

**What further AI iteration cannot do**: produce founder identity, customer references, or Big 4 contacts. Those are human-network artifacts.

**Recommendation**: STOP autonomous-loop documentation iteration. Hand to founder for Section 11 population + 30-day diligence sprint. Next eval cycle (if any) should be **post-pitch retrospective** (Day 30–45), not pre-pitch document refinement.

